{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2013-common-biology-10","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2013,"subject":"biology","number":10,"points":2,"unitId":"respiratory","unitLabel":"호흡계","topic":"폐포·이산화탄소분압·호흡중추","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["respiratory","circulation","signaling"],"stem":"표는 동일 조건에서 어떤 사람의 호흡 양상에 따른 호흡 관련 \n지수의 변화를 나타낸 것이다.\n일회호흡량 \n분당\n폐포환기용적 \n호흡 양상\n(mL)\n호흡 횟수\n(mL)\n정상\n500\n12\n350\n(가)\n300\n20\n150\n(나)\n750\n8\n600\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? \n(단, 이 사람이 정상 호흡을 할 때 동맥혈 이산화탄소분압은 40 mmHg\n이다.)\n<보 기>\nㄱ. (가) 호흡을 지속하면 호흡성산증이 유발된다.\nㄴ. (가) 호흡을 지속하면 실제 기체 교환이 이루어지는 공기량은\n정상보다 증가한다.\nㄷ. (나) 호흡을 지속하면 화학수용체가 자극을 받아 호흡중추가\n활성화된다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t031"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t032"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t033"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t034"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t035"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":691,"height":238,"region":0,"bbox":[31.5,53.303,276.4,95.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2013-common-biology-10/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":275,"region":0,"bbox":[14.3,231.703,310.4,110.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2013-common-biology-10/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":6,"sourceRect":[82.9,152.297,417.0,543.022],"width":334.1,"height":